explanation:
দেওয়া আছে,
P = {a, b, c}
এবং Q = {b, c, d}
∴ P ∪ Q = {a, b, c} ∪ {b, c, d}
= {a, b, c, d} (Ans.)

দেওয়া আছে,
P = {a, b, c}
এবং Q = {b, c, d}
∴ P ∩ Q = {a, b, c} ∩ {b, c, d}
= {b, c} (Ans.)

A × (B ∪ C)
= {(x, y) : x ∈ A, y ∈ B ∪ C}
= {(x, y) : x ∈ A, y ∈ B অথবা y ∈ C}
= {(x, y) : (x, y) ∈ A × B অথবা, (x, y) ∈ A × C}
= {(x, y) : (x, y) ∈ (A × B) ∪ (A × C)}
= (A × B) ∪ (A × C) (Ans.)
সুতরাং, যে-কোনো সেট A, B এবং C-এর জন্য
A × (B ∪ C) = (A × B) ∪ (A × C) (Ans.)
